        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bärɔw runi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Kuoth Nhial ruac kɛ Muthɛ wi̱i̱ Pa̱a̱m Thi-nay, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jiök ni ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl i̱, “Mi wiaa ben muun ëë cä ka̱m yɛ, kɛ run bärɔw ba päl ala duŋ Kuɔth ɛ /ca pith. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ run bäkɛl bia ka̱a̱kun pith, kä kɛ run bäkɛl bi ŋɔa̱a̱rkun ciɛk kä bia kɛ ŋɛ̈r. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö kɛ bärɔw runi ba ruɔ̱n lɔŋä muɔn, ɛ ruɔ̱n mi ca lëy Kuoth Nhial, cu ka̱a̱ku pith kä cu ŋɔa̱a̱rku ji̱thkiɛn ŋok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä /cia tin ciɛk kä rɔ bi ŋɛ̈r ka̱a̱nikun, kä /cia ŋɔa̱a̱r tin /ka̱n ji̱thkiɛn ŋuɔ̱k bi mat, ba ruɔ̱n lɔŋä muɔ̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A cäŋ /ka̱n mun pith ɛn runä mɔ mɔ bia tekɛ mi camɛ, kɛ kui̱dun kɛ ja̱a̱ŋkun wutni kɛnɛ män kɛ nɛy tin kɔakɛ kɛ tin cieŋ rɛydun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱ ɣɔ̱ɔ̱ku kɛnɛ le̱y dɔaar tin cieŋ muundun, kɛn ti diaal tin bi ciɛk bikɛn a mi̱th.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ruɔ̱n lucä ŋɔaani gua̱th ni kiɛn",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä bia gua̱th bärɔw kuɛnkä run bärɔw, kɛ ɣöö bikɛn a run ti jiɛɛn ŋuaan wi̱cdɛ bä ŋuan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bi jɔw kaaŋä jäk kä raar kɛ cäŋ kä wäl kä pay bärɔw, kɛ cäŋ luel bia kaaŋ Kuoth rɛy cieeŋnikun diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bia ruɔ̱n in jiɛɛn dhieecdiɛn jak kä ruɔ̱n mi gɔaa, kä bi yɛn tin diaal tin ciaŋkɛ mun lony, ba tɛth lɔaac kä yɛ, mi wa ram ɔ wä luɔc nyinäkɛ, kä bi ram ɔ loc dhɔɔrɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bi ruɔ̱n in jiɛɛn dhieecdiɛn a ruɔ̱n tɛthkä lɔacdun, ɛn runä mɔ /cia bi pi̱eth, kä /cia tin ci ciɛk kä rɔ bi ŋɛ̈r, kä /cia ŋɔa̱a̱r dɛykiɛn bi mat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö ɛ ruɔ̱n lucä ŋɔaani jɔk. Ba mi gɔaa kä yɛ, bia cam ni min ciɛk rɛy ka̱a̱ni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kɛn ruɔ̱n lucä ŋɔaani jɔk bi ram ɔ loc kä nyinkɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A mi tëë kɛ mi ci kök gua̱n thiekädu kiɛ ci duɔ̱ɔ̱r kɔk kä jɛ, /cuarɛ gak kɛ rɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ run tin guɔɔr kɛ ruɔ̱n lucä ŋɔaani gua̱th ni kiɛn, bi duɔ̱ɔ̱r kɔk kä gua̱n thieekädu, kä kɛ run tin piɛth kɛ ni bɛl, bɛ jɛ kök ji̱. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi ŋuan run bi kökdɛ rëp, kä mi kuiy run bi kökdɛ kuɛ̈ɛ̈, kök kɛ jɛ ji̱ kɛ run pithä bɛɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "/Cuarɛ gak kam ni kun, dualɛ kɛ Kuothdun. Kɛ ɣöö ɛ ɣän Kuoth Nhial Kuothdun.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Rik bärɔw runi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kɛ ɣöö nɔ bia lat ni ciɛŋkä, kä bia lueekä tit kä bia kɛ la̱t, bia cu cieŋ muun kɛ mal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bi mun dɛykɛ kuir, kä bia ria̱ŋ kɛ mi̱ethkɛ, kä bia cieŋ thi̱n kɛ mal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi wi̱i̱ jɛ wä lar i̱, ‘Ɛŋu mi banɛ cam kɛ run bärɔw, mi /canɛ bi pi̱eth kiɛ /canɛ bɛl bi dol rɛy ka̱a̱ni kɔn?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɣän Kuoth bä puɔ̱thdä ka̱m yɛ rɛy runi da̱ŋ bäkɛl, bi mun ciɛk kɛ bɛl kɛ run diɔ̱k. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi wiaa pi̱eth kɛ bädäk runi, bia cam ni bɛl tëë wal, amäni mi ci bɛl bäŋuan runi ciɛk, bia bɛl tëë thaar kulɛ cam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä /ca mun bi met kɔak, kɛ ɣöö mun ɛ duŋdä, kä kɛ ɣöö kɛ yɛn ja̱a̱l ti cieŋ kɛ ɣä kɛɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mun min mɔ duŋdu, bi jɛ tit i̱ tëë kɛ gua̱ndɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä mi dämuɔɔr ɛ can kä cɛ tha̱a̱ŋ nyinäkɛ kɔak, ji̱n gua̱n thiekädɛ bi nyin dämuɔɔr ben kök jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi thilɛ ram mi kök ɛ jɛ, mi /cɛ tekɛ ŋɔak bɛ nyɔk kɛ kök. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä a guic run tëë cɛ kɔk ni jɛ kä bɛ yio̱w ti kɔ̱ŋ yuɔ̱r ram ëë cɛ kök jɛ, kä bɛ cu loc kuakni kɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi thilɛ duɔ̱p mi /cɛ jek kɛ ɣöö derɛ nyɔk kɛ kök, bi min cɛ kɔak te tetdä raam min ci jɛ kɔk amäni ruɔ̱n in luɔckɛ ni ŋɔak gua̱th ni kiɛn. Kɛn ruɔ̱n ɛmɔ ba luɔcɛ, kä bɛ cu loc rɛy nyinäkɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mi ci raan duel thuɔp kɔak rɛy rɛ̈ɛ̈k, dërɛ jɛ luɔ̱c jɔk kɛ kɔr runä mi kɔkɛ ni jɛ, kɛ kɔr runä kɛl, tëë cuɔ̱ŋ kɛ ɣöö derɛ jɛ luɔc jɔk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi /kenɛ jɛ luɔc jɔk kɛ kɔr runä, ɛn duel thuɔp ɛ mɔ ba duŋ raam min ci jɛ kɔk, rɛy kuay nikɛ, /ca jɛ bi lony runä min luɔckɛ ni ŋɔak gua̱th ni kiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö duel tin ka̱n la̱t kɛ thop duel rɛy cieŋ ce̱tkɛ kɛ ka̱a̱k wec, dëë kɛ lony, ba kɛ lony runä tɛthkä lɔaac. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ bä bi ji̱ Lii-bay tekɛ cuɔ̱ŋ kɛ luuc duëlikiɛn jɔk, ti̱ec tin te rɛ̈ɛ̈kdiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi ci raan Lii-bay duel kɔak kä cɛ jɛ luäŋ kɛ luuc jɔk, ɛn duel ɛ cɛ kɔak ɔ rɛy rɛ̈ɛ̈kdiɛn ba luɔ̱c jɔk runä tɛthkä lɔaac, kɛ ɣöö duel tin te rɛy wec ji̱ Lii-bay, kɛ ti̱eckiɛn rɛy ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä muɔn tin te rɛy wecdiɛn ca kɛ bi kɔak, kɛ ɣöö ɛ di̱el muɔndiɛn.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋua̱l mi ka̱mkɛ can",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä mi dämuɔɔr cia̱ can ɔ, kä cɛ rɔ luäŋ ce̱tkɛ ji̱, lät ni jɛ, ce̱tkɛ ram mi guä kiɛ ram mi cieŋ kɛ kɛ ji̱. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu duɔ̱ɔ̱r kän kä jɛ kiɛ cuɛ mac, duali kɛ Kuothdu, kɛ ɣöö bi dämuɔɔr cieŋ kɛ ji̱ kɛɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "/Cu jɛ ŋuäl yio̱o̱ku kɛ bikɛ rëp, kä /cu jɛ käm mi̱ethdu kɛ bi duɔ̱ɔ̱r jek thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ ɣän Kuoth Nhial Kuothdu, mëë käm yɛ raar muun I-jëp kä käm yɛ mun Kɛ-naan, kɛ ɣöö ba̱a̱ Kuothdun.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Luɔ̱ny ja̱a̱ŋni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä mi ci dämuɔɔr ɛ can gekädu, kä cɛ rɔ kök ji̱, /cu jɛ jak kä lät ce̱tkɛ läät. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bɛ tekɛ kɛ ji̱ ce̱tkɛ ram kɔki ni jɛ kiɛ cieŋ kɛ ji̱ kɛɛl. Bɛ lät kɛ kɛ ji̱ mäni ruɔ̱n tɛthkä lɔaac. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛnɔ bɛ cu jiɛɛn kä ji̱, jɛn kɛnɛ gaatkɛ, bɛ cu loc dhɔrɛ, wi̱i̱ panɔmä gua̱n bɛ loc thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö kɛ ja̱a̱ŋ Kuɔth Nhial, tëë kämɛ raar rööl I-jëp, ca kɛ bi kɔk ala ja̱a̱ŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä /cu jɛ ruac kɛ ko̱r, luthni Kuothdu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ja̱a̱ŋku tɔ̱ tëë ji̱ tɔ̱ wutni kiɛ män, deri ja̱ŋ wutdä kiɛ ciek kɔk kä nɛy tɔ̱ te thieekädu tɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Deri kɔk kɛ ja̱ŋ rɛy nɛɛni tɔ̱ guä tɔ̱ cieŋ kɛ ji̱ kɛ tɔ̱ kɛ ji̱ dho̱rikiɛn tɔ̱ tekɛ kɛ ji̱ tɔ, tɔ̱ dapkɛ muundu tɔ, dëë cukɛ a nyinku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Deri kɛ ba̱ny gaatku, ala nyinkiɛn ti do̱raar, deri kɛ lɛl ala ja̱a̱ŋ, kä ci gaat muɔr ni ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl bi ruac, kɛl kɛ̈ɛ̈li, kɛ buɔ̱m.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mi ɛ ram mi guä kiɛ ram min cieŋ kɛ yɛ ci riäŋ ɔ, kä ci dämuɔɔr ɛ can kä cɛ rɔ kök ram mi guä kiɛ ram min cieŋ kɛ yɛ, kiɛ raan dhɔaar nɛɛni ti guä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dëë nyɔk kɛ mi kɔak kɛ jɛ, dëë ram kɛl kä gaat man ɛ nyɔk kɛ kök, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kiɛ gua̱nlendɛ kiɛ gat waydɛ derɛ jɛ kɔk, kiɛ ram kɛl kä ji̱ dhɔaariɛn, kiɛ mi cɛ tëë ŋɔak derɛ rɔ kɔk kä rɔaadɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bɛ ruac kɛ ram mi ci jɛ kɔk nikɛ ruɔ̱n ëë kɔkɛ ni rɔ amäni ruɔ̱n tɛthkä lɔaac, bɛ pëk yio̱o̱ni tin kɔkɛ ni rɔ a pëk runi, kɛ ruɔ̱n ëë tëë jɛ kä ram ëë kɔk jɛ bɛ thöp ala pëk raam mi läät. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi ŋot run kɛ ŋuan, ce̱tkɛ min ci kɛn ɛ lat bɛ yio̱w tëë ca kɔk ni jɛ thöp ala yio̱w ti lonyɛ ni rɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi ci run kuɛ̈ɛ̈ a ci thia̱k ni ruɔ̱n lucä ŋɔaani gua̱th ni kiɛn, bɛ ruac kɛ ram ëë kɔk jɛ, kɛ pëk runi te ci lät kɛ jɛ bɛ kɛ thöp ala ti luɛlɛ ni rɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi ɛ ja̱ŋ mi lät ruɔ̱n kɛ ruɔ̱n bɛ tekɛ jɛ kɛɛl, a /cɛ ruac kɛ buɔ̱m nhiamdu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi /kenɛ rɔ luɛl kɛn dup ɛ tɔ, ba lony runä lucä ŋɔaani gua̱th ni kiɛn, jɛn kɛnɛ gaatkɛ kɛɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
